                  },
                  {
                    "text": "NH"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", so it is acidic. Since the cation makes the solution acidic and the anion has no effect, the solution is acidic."
                  }
