              "feedback": {
                "content": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Incorrect. Recall that: Cations of strong bases and anions of strong acids have no effect on pH. Anions of weak acids react with water to form OH"
                      },
                      {
                        "sup": true,
                        "text": "-"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": " and therefore increase pH. Cations that are conjugate acids of weak bases react with water to form H"
                      },
                      {
                        "sub": true,
                        "text": "3"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "O"
                      },
                      {
                        "sup": true,
                        "text": "+"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": " and therefore decrease pH. If the anion is basic and the cation is acidic, compare the "
                      },
                      {
                        "em": true,
                        "text": "K"
                      },
                      {
                        "em": true,
                        "sub": true,
                        "text": "a"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": " of the acid component of the substance to the "
                      },
                      {
                        "em": true,
                        "text": "K"
                      },
                      {
                        "em": true,
                        "sub": true,
                        "text": "b"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": " of the base component of the substance to determine which has the larger effect."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "lso4wnjn5iyix7h",
